    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "AVECo",
      "x": 1740,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 375,
      "height": 96,
      "content": "Anim — Arc: indeterminate chase (Material-style). Phase A: tail fixed, head extends minSweep(27°)→maxSweep(252°). Phase B: head fixed, tail catches up. Whole arc rotates around circle continuously. ~2s/loop, easeInOutCubic. Check: draws once on enter (path-stroke reveal ~500ms). Particles: drift outward + fade out, loop ~2s (staggered). Loading dots: brightness wave L→R ~1.2s."
    },
